-Now, we demonstrate the practical application of our potential
-anomaly detection framework using real-world datasets. This
-involves integrating the anomaly detection methods, machine
-learning techniques, and evaluation metrics discussed earlier to
-create a comprehensive approach for identifying fraudulent
-transactions. The implementation showcases the effectiveness of
